opment**: Transform research into structured skills using `ski"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ll-creator` in Claude Code\n3. **Validation**: Test skill-generated code examples to ensure correctne"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ss\n4. **Maintenance**: Regular updates based on latest official documentation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Available Skills"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### TileLang Developer\nWrite high-performance GPU kernels using TileLang for NVIDIA, AMD, and Ascend"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ng Developer\nWrite high-performance GPU kernels using TileLang for NVIDIA, AMD, and Ascend hardware."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Capabilities:**\n- Matrix multiplication (GEMM) kernels\n- FlashAttention implementations\n- DeepSeek"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" MLA operators\n- Performance optimization (swizzle layouts, pipelining, warp specialization)\n- Cross"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"-platform kernel development"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Status:** ✅ Complete"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Megatron Memory Estimator\nEstimate GPU memory usage for Megatron-based MoE and dense models. Bui"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"lt upon megatron_memory_estimator."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Capabilities:**\n- Estimate memory from HuggingFace configs\n- Support for MoE models (DeepSeek-V3, "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"Qwen, etc.)\n- Parallelism strategy comparison (TP/PP/EP/CP)\n- Memory optimization recommendations"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Status:** ✅ Complete"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### SLIME User\nGuide for using SLIME (LLM post-training framework for RL Scaling). Built upon THUDM/"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"IME User\nGuide for using SLIME (LLM post-training framework for RL Scaling). Built upon THUDM/slime."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Capabilities:**\n- RL training setup and configuration (GRPO, GSPO, PPO, Reinforce++)\n- Multi-turn "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"tool calling and agent workflows\n- Custom reward models and generation functions\n- Megatron and FSDP"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" backend configuration\n- SGLang integration and optimization\n- Dynamic sampling and partial rollout\n"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"- Multi-node distributed training"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Status:** ✅ Complete"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Prompt to create this skill, with Sonnet 4.5:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### TikZ Flowchart\nCreate professional flowcharts and architecture diagrams using LaTeX TikZ with st"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"\nCreate professional flowcharts and architecture diagrams using LaTeX TikZ with standardized styles."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Capabilities:**\n- Professional flowcharts with Google Material-like color palette\n- Standardized n"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ode types (data, memory, operation, kernel boxes)\n- Architecture diagrams and process flows\n- Groupi"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ng and layout best practices\n- Clean orthogonal edges and relative positioning"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"**Example Output:** QAT Flowchart | Anthropic Theme"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**Status:** ✅ Complete"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Material You Slides\nCreate presentation slide decks using Material You (Material Design 3) desig"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"l You Slides\nCreate presentation slide decks using Material You (Material Design 3) design language."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Capabilities:**\n- Self-contained HTML slides (1280x720) with M3 color tokens\n- Roboto typography w"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ith multiple weight support\n- Professional slide types (title, section divider, content)\n- Component"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" library (cards, flow diagrams, metric cards, code blocks)\n- Rounded shapes and generous whitespace\n"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"- Surface hierarchy without drop shadows\n- Structured layouts (columns, tables, lists, tags/chips)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**Example Output:** SLIME RL Training Slides"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Status:** ✅ Complete"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Anthropic Theme Flowchart\nCreate polished standalone HTML/CSS flowcharts with Anthropic-inspired"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" pastel styling, reliable geometry, and deterministic connector routing."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"**Capabilities:**\n- TS-first flowchart specs that generate standalone HTML artifacts\n- Deterministic"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" node geometry and anchor-based connector routing\n- Transparent dashed grouping frames and pastel ro"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"le-based node styling\n- Hollow `>` arrowheads and orthogonal bridge connectors\n- Gallery-ready expor"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ts generated from the same geometry source"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"**Example Output:** Review Demo PNG"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**Status:** ✅ Complete"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### HF Architecture TikZ\nGenerate Sebastian-Raschka-gallery-style TikZ architecture diagrams for any"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" HuggingFace decoder-only LLM, with per-block parameter formulas and concrete numbers."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**Capabilities:**\n- Extract architecture from HuggingFace configs into a structured spec\n- Render pu"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"blication-quality vertical TikZ diagrams via Jinja templates\n- Annotate every sub-block with paramet"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"er formulas and concrete numbers\n- Support MHA, GQA, MLA, Hyper-Connections, sparse attention with l"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"earned indexer\n- Cover dense and MoE FFNs (incl. hash routing) and MTP heads\n- Models: DeepSeek-V4-F"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"lash, Qwen, Llama, Mistral, gpt-oss, etc."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**Example Output:** DeepSeek-V4-Flash PNG | PDF"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"**Status:** ✅ Complete"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### OpenAI Dotcom Viz\nBuild figures in OpenAI's blog / research / system-card \"dotcom\" visual style,"},{"id":"p37s2","text":" emitted as self-contained HTML/SVG with zero dependencies."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"**Capabilities:**\n- Monochrome bar charts (darker same-hue stroke, rounded corners, black y-axis wit"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"h outward ticks, no gridlines, circle legend markers, value labels above bars, angled category label"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"s)\n- Flow / process diagrams (rounded boxes, monospace uppercase pills, pink highlights, thin open-c"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"hevron connectors, dashed negative branches)\n- Real OpenAI Sans typography with zero external depend"},{"id":"p38s5","text":" connectors, dashed negative branches)\n- Real OpenAI Sans typography with zero external dependencies"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"**Status:** ✅ Complete"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Planned Skills"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### SGLang Developer\nDevelopment skill for SGLang (Structured Generation Language) runtime and optim"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"ng Developer\nDevelopment skill for SGLang (Structured Generation Language) runtime and optimization."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Planned capabilities:**\n- SGLang runtime configuration\n- Custom sampling strategies\n- Performance "},{"id":"p42s2","text":"tuning for LLM inference\n- Multi-GPU serving optimization"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
